  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amendment secondment (Christina Dahlman) to Unesco Paris within the area Media and Communication/Unesco Assistance Programme to  Independant Media in Conflict Areas during 2002-2004. The purpose for the secondment with Unesco is that Sida finds it valuation to improve the joint knowledge between Unesco and Sina in the areas of Media and Armed Conflicts and serve as a base for further collaboration.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xF6;rl&#xE4;ngning sekondering (Christina Dahlman) till Unesco Paris inom samarbetsomr&#xE5;det Medier och Kommunikation (Unesco Assistance Programme to Independent Media in Conlict Areas) under 2005. Syftet med sekonderingen &#xE4;r att Sida anser det angel&#xE4;get att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra den gemensamma kunskapen mellan Unesco och Sida inom omr&#xE5;det Media och Bev&#xE4;pnade Konflikter samt tj&#xE4;na som en bas f&#xF6;r fortsatt samarbete.</narrative>
  </description>
